&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:wordvisicarriagereturn_msfontservice,calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;PORTLAND,&amp;nbsp;Ore., (Jan&amp;nbsp;22,&amp;nbsp;2026) &mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family:lato,lato_embeddedfont,lato_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;As cold temperatures&amp;nbsp;linger&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;the region, Pacific Power is reminding customers&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a few&amp;nbsp;simple adjustments&amp;nbsp;they can make at home that&amp;nbsp;can help them stay&amp;nbsp;warm&amp;nbsp;while&amp;nbsp;also&amp;nbsp;reducing their&amp;nbsp;energy bill.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&ldquo;With households using more electricity to stay comfortable during winter months, adopting energy-efficient heating practices benefits everyone,&rdquo;&amp;nbsp;said Ryan Flynn, president of Pacific Power. &ldquo;Even small changes support the grid and can lead to significant savings on your monthly bill.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;To help customers get started, Pacific Power&amp;nbsp;recommends&amp;nbsp;taking&amp;nbsp;these practical steps to&amp;nbsp;help&amp;nbsp;keep their energy costs in check&amp;nbsp;this winter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Tips for staying warm&amp;nbsp;and energy-efficient:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;68&deg;&amp;nbsp;degrees is great&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Setting&amp;nbsp;the thermostat at&amp;nbsp;68&deg;F when&amp;nbsp;you&rsquo;re&amp;nbsp;home and awake is recommended.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep warm air in&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Close window coverings at night to reduce drafts, and seal air leaks with caulking and weatherstripping around doors and windows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clean and tune&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Clean or replace furnace filters monthly during the heating season. Routine maintenance helps improve airflow and ensures your system&amp;nbsp;isn&rsquo;t&amp;nbsp;working harder than necessary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use space heaters sparingly&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;and safely&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Portable&amp;nbsp;heaters require a lot of electricity and should be used only as needed. Running a typical 1,500-watt unit for eight hours a day over a month can add about $30 to&amp;nbsp;a winter&amp;nbsp;bill.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;
     &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use appliances during off-peak hours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&ndash;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Using appliances&amp;nbsp;like ovens, dishwashers and laundry machines during off-peak hours helps reduce strain on the grid and can help customers manage their&amp;nbsp;bill&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;approach Pacific Power also highlights during extreme weather.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
     &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW245021263 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"&gt;
